","Wallet Information":"Wallet Information","Wallet Mode":"Wallet Mode","Wallet Name":"Wallet Name","Wallet No":"Wallet No","Wallet No.":"Wallet No.","Wallet Transfer":"Wallet Transfer","Wallet Unload":"Wallet Unload","Wallet Unload History":"Wallet Unload History","Wallet added successfully":"Wallet added successfully",Wallet_Deposit_Mixed:"Wallet / Deposit / Mixed",Wallet_Holder:"Wallet Holder",Wallet_Id:"Wallet Id",Wallet_Mode:"Wallet Mode",Wallet_Name:"Wallet Name",Wallet_No:"Wallet No",Wallet_UnloadAC:"Wallet Unload AC","Wallet_Unload_A/c":"Wallet Unload A/c",Wallet_Unload_AC:"Wallet Unload AC",Wallet_Unload_Ac:"Wallet Unload A/c",Wallets:"Wallets","Want To Delete This Device":"Want To Delete This Device","Want To Register This Device":"Do you want to register this device?","Want To Unblock This Device":"Want To Unblock This Device","Want To block This Device":"Want To block This Device",Warning:"Warning","Water Bill":"Water Bill","Water Bill Screen":"Water Bill Screen",We_are_introducing_you_to_Radiant_Cash_Management_Services_Limited_one_of_the_largest_CMS_service_providers_in_India:"We are introducing you to Radiant Cash Management Services Limited, one of the largest CMS service providers in India","Web Login Permission":"Web Login Permission","Web Site":"Web Site","Website Login (Web)":"Website Login (Web)","Website description":"Website User Login Live Information is given below, which you can change as per your need and understanding. Please understand the impact before changing.",Weclome:"Weclome!",Wednesday:"Wednesday","Weekly Passcode":"Weekly Passcode","Welcome To":"Welcome To","What's improved in this update?":"What's improved in this update?",What_can_be_the_solution:"What can be the solution?",WhatsApp:"WhatsApp","WhatsApp is not installed":"WhatsApp is not installed",Whats_New:"What's New?",Withdraw:"Withdraw",Wl:"Wl","Work In Other Code Area":"Work In Other Code Area","Work Service Agreement":"Work Service Agreement",Work_Mode:"Work Mode",X:"X",