self, bank security cheque",Zero_amount_is_not_allowed:"Zero amount is not allowed.",aadhaarpanrequired:"Aadhaar or Pan Number is required when amount is more than \u20b9 24999/-",aadhaarscan:"Scan your Aadhaar QR and fill in the details below.",aadharCard:"Aadhaar Card",aadharNumber:"Aadhaar Number",aadhar_card:"aadhar_card",aadhar_length_error:"Aadhar number must be at least 12 characters",about_company_text_1:"Radiant Cash Management Services Limited cater to broad set of outsourcing requirements pertaining to cash management services for banks, financial institutions, organized retail and e-commerce companies in India. Company operate our business across five verticals.",about_company_text_2:"Depending on the volume, the company uses multiple modes of transport for movement of cash and valuables, two wheelers, hired vehicles and specially built armoured vans. The company handles cash transactions of around Rs 5000 - 6000 million daily from all the customers.",about_company_text_3:"The Company services under this segment consist of cash collection from end user and deposit into company current accounts and subsequent transfer to the client\u2019s accounts either on the same day or on the next working day. The Company believes that our network of more than 60,000 touch points and a wide network of bank accounts with various banks across the country allows use to offer a unique value proposition to company clients, especially private sector and foreign banks, with limited branch networks.",about_us:"About Us",acHolder:"Account Holder",accMsg:"Below are the links to the accounts activity, which you can search according to your convenience",account:"Account",accountNumber:"Account Number",account_mismatch:"Account numbers do not match",accountant:"Accountant",active_mode_is:"active mode is",add_acc:"Add Account",add_max_2_users:"You can add a maximum of 2 users only.",add_money:"Add Money",add_new:"Add New",add_new_customer_info:"Add New Customer Point Information",add_new_info_instruction:"If you need to add new information, you can add it by clicking on 'Add New'.",add_new_pickup_desc:"Enter the pickup time, online slip or physical slip number and full details of the currency picked up from the customer point, also the count of all types of notes should match the total amount exactly.",addressInfo:"Address Information",addressLine1:"Address Line 1",addressLine2:"Address Line 2",addsubmitReferralData:"Add/Submit Referral DATA",administrator:"Administrator",alert:"alert",all_fields_required:"All fields must be filled",allows_use_to_offer_a_unique_value:"allows use to offer a unique value",already_have_account:"Already have an account?",ambika:"ambika","and the":"and the",androidApk:"To send or copy the Android App link, click on the following button as per your requirement",apkMsg:"Dear Partner, you can easily share the mobile app link Android and iOS with any other person. You have both store or self website options to download the APK.",apkShare:"Mobile Application Link",appupdate:"You have an old version app so please update your app","as per india currency":"as per india currency",authenticationRequired:"Authentication Required",back:"Back",balance:"Balance",bankInfo:"Bank Information",bankName:"Bank Name",bank_down_note:"Note: Currently the beneficiary bank's server is down or busy, please try after sometime.",bank_info:"Bank Information",bank_ref_id:"bank_ref_id",bank_reference_no:"Bank Reference No",banking_name:"banking_name",believes_that_our_network_of_more:"believes that our network of more","bill info":"bill info",business_name:"Business Name",business_type:"Business Type",button1:"button1",camera:"camera",cameraassces:"The user needs camera access to take pictures to upload profile photos",cancel:"cancel",cashLimit:"Cash Limit",cash_deposit_ac_list_desc:"Through this function we are sharing with you the list of Radiant Cash Management Services Limited bank accounts and QR Codes in which you can Deposit Cash, Online Transfer and QR Code Scan.",cash_online_deposit_desc:"In this report, the money deposited by RCE in the bank cash counter, the money deposited in the Cash Deposit Machine (CDM) and the money transferred by any other online mode can be seen in this report.",cash_pickup_prepay_desc:"Money is picked up by RCE from the customer point or dropped off by the customer and through whatever medium the money is given to the company, the complete credit debit report will be in this ledger.",cash_pickup_report_desc:"This report will give complete details of payment collection done by the RC from the customer location, whether the RCE has made the payment through digital slip or through physical slip.",cashposh:"Cash & Posh",change_language:"Change Language",change_voice_notification:"change voice notification",charges:"Charges",checking_status:"checking status",checklist_confirmation:"Yes, I have checked all the details and also got it verified from store contact person that the information is completely correct and I will take further action.",choose_image_source:"choose_image_source",city:"City",cityName:"City Name","click Again Please":"click Again Please","click on \"Resend Button\"":"click on \"Resend Button\"","click upon Resend Button":"click upon Resend Button",click_on_Resend_Button:"click on \"Resend Button\"",clientCustomerName:"- Client  / Customer Name  -",close:"close",cms_ac_list_desc:"Below is the list of accounts available for cash deposit in Radiant Cash Management Services Limited. Please choose the appropriate account as per your convenience. You can choose any branch where you do not have to face the crowd and your time is also\xa0not\xa0wasted.",cms_ac_list_note:"Below is the list of accounts available for cash deposit in Radiant Cash Management Services Limited. Please choose the appropriate account as per your convenience. You can choose any branch where you do not have to face the crowd and your time is also not wasted.",cms_checkbox_msg:"Yes, I have checked all the details and also got it verified from store contact person that the information is completely correct and I will take further action.",cms_status_sorry_msg:"for the inconvenience, but the verification of the scratch code from the customer point has not been completed yet. For security reasons, we cannot allow you to proceed until the verification of the scratch code is complete. Please inform the customer point so that the verification can be completed as soon as possible.",cms_verify_otp_msg:". If everything is okay, complete the transaction by entering the OTP. The OTP has been sent to the store contact person with the details of the total amount.",collection_agent:"Collection Agent",company_docs_deposit_desc:"To deposit cash in banks, some important documents of the company may be required, such as PAN Card, which is required in most banks. Some banks may also ask for additional documents, download documents from here.",confirm:"Confirm",confirm_password:"Confirm Password",consume_limit:"Consume limit",contact_info_updated_till:"Contact information updated till",contact_no_colon:"Contact No:",contact_person_number_given_below:"Contact person and number are given below,",continue:"continue",current_accounts_and_subsequent:"current accounts and subsequent",customerName:"Customer Name",customerPointName:"Customer Point Name",customerStatus:"Customer Status",customer_name:"Customer Name",customer_point_address:"Customer Point Address",customer_point_details:"Customer Point Details",customer_point_info:"Customer Point Information",dark_mode_content:"In Dark Mode, all colors are fixed and cannot be changed. Once Dark Mode is enabled, any changes to the default colors will not remove Dark Mode. To remove Dark Mode, you must manually turn off the button.",dark_mode_setting:"dark mode setting",dateOfBirth:"Date of Birth",date_of_birth:"Date of Birth",date_time:"date_time",delete_account:"Delete Account",delivery_boy:"Delivery Boy",dematAccounts:"DEMAT ACCOUNTS",depositMode:"Deposit Mode",deposit_slip_cms_desc:"Some banks require a separate deposit slip to deposit money. All the slips required for these banks can be downloaded from here and you can use them by taking a print out (Print Slip)of them.",description:"Dear Retail Partner, you can change your profile details before authentication. After authentication, you cannot change your verified status, you can only change your profile details/Upload.",designation:"Designation",designation_colon:"Designation:",details:"Dear business partner please enter all the required correct information or scan the Aadhaar card QR code",district:"DISTRICT",dlt:{"Delete Acc & Clear Data":"Delete Acc & Clear Data","Please Read Carefully !":"Please Read Carefully !",description:"You can permanently delete your account. After deleting this account, you will not be able to access it in the future and all information will be deleted. After deleting the account, all records of services used by you will also be deleted, which cannot be retrieved later. Only delete when you agree.",Delete:"Delete",Cancel:"Cancel","Press me if you agree to the deletion":"Press me if you agree to the deletion","Are you sure you want to delete your account?":"Are you sure you want to delete your account?","":""},dob_format:"Date of Birth (dd/mm/yyyy)",done_button:"done_button",email:"Email",emailOrMobile:"Email or Mobile Number",email_already_exists:"Email already exists.",email_exists_error:"Your Email Already Exists With Us. Please Try Another Email Id",email_hint:"Enter your email",email_id:"Email ID",email_id_colon:"Email ID:",email_verified_success:"Email verified successfully",enter_email_first:"Please enter email first",enter_mobile_first:"Please enter mobile number first",enter_password:"Enter Password",error_occurred:"Error Occurred!",error_occurred_try_later:"An error occurred, please try again later",error_sending_otp:"Error sending OTP.",failed:"failed",failed_send_otp:"Failed to send OTP",failed_title:"Failed",fill_name_mobile_email:"Please fill name, mobile and email before submitting.",financial_services:"Financial Services",first:"You can transfer money to any bank account through NEFT (National Electronic Fund Transfer) or IMPS (Immediate Fund Transfer Service) for your business purposes, salary and others.","for successful pickup":"for successful pickup",forgotPassword:"Forgot Password?","from Admin":"from Admin","from Master":"from Master",fullName:"Full Name",gallery:"gallery",gender:"Gender",go_home:"go_home",go_to_login:"Go to Login Screen",green:"green",greenLineClosed:"greenLineClosed",green_line_aeps:"green_line_aeps",gst_length_error:"GST number must be at least 15 characters",gst_optional:"GST (Optional)",health:"health",help:"Help & Support",hi:"hi",hindi:"Hindi",home:"Home",home_page:"Home",home_screen_title:"home screen title",ifYouWantToAdd:"If you want to add a new customer point or make a referral, please click on this tab...","ifsc code..":"ifsc code..",ifscCode:"IFSC Code",important:"important","indian currency denominations":"Indian Currency Denominations",indian_currency_denominations:"indian currency denominations",insertTime:"Insert Time",intentapp:"intent_app",invalid_otp:"Invalid OTP",invalid_otp_request_failed:"Invalid OTP or request failed.",iosMsg:"To send or copy the IOS app link, click on the following button as per your requirement","is Pending":"is Pending",is_Pending:"is Pending",is_already_exists:"is already exists",issue_fetching_data_error:"There was an issue fetching the data. Please try again.",join_now:"Join Now",key_aadhaarky_155:"* Aadhaar KYC fee 3 + GST will be debited from retail wallet",key_aadhaarpa_141:"Aadhaar Pay service cannot be used with Wallet service.",key_according_185:"According to company rules and regulations, a retail executive can generate a maximum of five zero-value pickup slips from a particular store each month.",key_addalaye_136:"Add a layer of biometric security to protect your transactions and personal data.",key_addressno_6:"Address not found. GPS coordinates will be used.",key_administra_184:"Administrator is running low on balance to complete the transaction.\r\n                                    Please notify the administrator by calling the mobile number provided below.",key_anerroro_10:"An error occurred while submitting the dispute.",key_anerroro_11:"An error occurred while uploading documents.",key_anerroro_12:"An error occurred. Please try again later.",key_anerroro_13:"An Error Occurred While Fetching Bank Accounts",key_anerroro_14:"An error occurred while fetching bank accounts",key_anerroro_15:"An error occurred while uploading the image.",key_anerroro_16:"An error occurred while uploading the image.",key_anerroro_7:"An error occurred while processing the fund transfer.",key_anerroro_8:"An error occurred while processing the request.",key_anerroro_9:"An error occurred while processing your request. Please try again.",key_askthecu_179:"Ask the Customer Contact Person for a 6 character sketch code and\xa0enter\xa0it\xa0here",key_asperthe_140:"As per the norms, Aadhaar Pay service cannot be used with Wallet service.",key_asproofo_17:"As proof of address, if they have different permanent address & Current Address",key_beloware_18:"Below are two ways to add a UPI payment to your wallet. Please select the method you want to add the payment through. In QR mode, a QR code will open that will be valid for only 1 minute. In intent mode, you will be able to make payments directly from any UPI mobile application installed on your mobile.",key_belowist_175:"Below is the list of accounts available for cash deposit\r\n                            in Radiant Cash Management Services Limited. Please choose\r\n                            the appropriate account as per your convenience. You can\r\n                            choose any branch where you do not have to face the crowd\r\n                            and your time is also\xa0not\xa0wasted.",key_but